      "id": "claim_b491b838d29f4aa29e4d7edfdf01247b",
      "statement": "A frozen-tile set is a FrozenTileMap keyed by \"x,y\" coordinate strings (built via toFrozenKey); each FrozenTile records a single owner (player_a or player_b) and an optional scoredAxes audit array. Physical membership (key in the map) is the test for whether a coordinate is frozen.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/game-engine/frozenTiles.ts#L24-L40",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d42c82b67278d719f895d2cd2a172e2c4511f1a569b8a5102d0d989148a9ab35:"
