    {
      "id": "claim_f9999de4f075447ea3256904d3a87c50",
      "statement": "Frozen-tile ownership is first-owner-wins: resolveOwnership keeps the existing owner rather than reassigning it, so once a tile is frozen its owner never changes even when the other player later scores a word through the same tile.",
