    {
      "id": "claim_7f2ee4c13af14197a8c10251767e9b37",
      "statement": "Tiles freeze at the end of a swap's scoring pass: freezeTiles takes the scored words plus the existing frozen map and returns a FreezeResult (updatedFrozenTiles, newlyFrozen, wasPartialFreeze, unfrozenRemaining). The word engine invokes it once per processed swap after validation and scoring.",
