    {
      "id": "claim_6fe96e262a45423cb68ee2612e3d3afc",
      "statement": "freezeTiles enforces a 24-unfrozen floor: MIN_UNFROZEN_TILES=24 caps freezes at MAX_FROZEN_TILES=BOARD_TILE_COUNT-24=76. When a round's new tiles would breach the floor, freezing is partial (new tiles frozen in reading order up to remaining capacity, remainder left unfrozen, wasPartialFreeze set) while the words still score full points.",
      "evidence": [
        {
