    {
      "id": "claim_d66d144611194d6f8716a086aedd04c5",
      "statement": "A swap may not target a frozen tile on either endpoint: the word engine's per-move handler rejects a move when either the from or to key is already in the frozen map (including tiles frozen earlier in the same round), returning empty breakdowns and an unchanged board.",
