      "statement": "Opponent-owned frozen tiles are excluded from letter points but not from the length bonus: scoreBoardWords blanks tiles whose frozen owner is the opponent slot before summing letter values, while calculateLengthBonus uses the full word length including opponent-frozen tiles.",
