      "statement": "Both scoring passes for a round (the instant-scoring fast path and advanceRound's combined pass) score against the round-start freeze baseline rounds.frozen_tiles_before (falling back to matches.frozen_tiles for legacy rounds); the fast path's mid-round freezes only gate new swap submissions via the live matches.frozen_tiles map and must not feed back into the same round's scoring.",
